  <!-- EN: Adjust the material cost of customizing weapons. At 0%, customization is free. Default: {0}%. -->
  <UWU_TraitCostMultiplierDesc>調整自訂武器所需的材料成本。設為0%時，自訂不需任何成本。預設值：{0}%。</UWU_TraitCostMultiplierDesc>
