  <UWU_RefundRateNoEffect>特質成本倍率為0%時，特質返還率不會有任何作用。</UWU_RefundRateNoEffect>
  <!-- EN: Derive base cost from crafting recipe -->
  <UWU_UseRecipeBaseCost>依製作配方推算基礎成本</UWU_UseRecipeBaseCost>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, the cost of adding a trait will be based on the weapon's crafting recipe. When disabled, every weapon of the same tech level will use the same flat cost, so cheap weapons no longer have cheap traits. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_UseRecipeBaseCostDesc>啟用時，加入特質的成本會依武器的製作配方計算。停用時，同一科技等級的每把武器都使用相同的固定成本，因此便宜的武器不再有便宜的特質。預設值：{0}。</UWU_UseRecipeBaseCostDesc>
  <!-- EN: Rare trait cost cap: {0}x -->
  <UWU_RarityCostCap>稀有特質成本上限：{0}倍</UWU_RarityCostCap>
  <!-- EN: A trait's rarity is how rarely it appears on unique weapons found in the world. Rarer traits cost more, up to this many times their base cost. At 1x, rarity does not affect cost. Default: {0}x. -->
  <UWU_RarityCostCapDesc>特質的稀有度，指它出現在世界上獨特武器上的罕見程度。越稀有的特質成本越高，最高可達其基礎成本的這個倍數。設為1倍時，稀有度不影響成本。預設值：{0}倍。</UWU_RarityCostCapDesc>
  <!-- EN: Advanced trait minimum cost: {0}% -->
  <UWU_ComplexityFloorScale>太空科技特質最低成本：{0}%</UWU_ComplexityFloorScale>
  <!-- EN: Spacer-tech traits will always cost a minimum number of advanced components, even on weapons made without components, such as melee weapons and bows. At 0%, there is no minimum. Default: {0}%. -->
  <UWU_ComplexityFloorScaleDesc>太空科技特質至少要消耗一定數量的高級零件，即使是不用零件製作的武器也一樣，例如近戰武器與弓。設為0%時不設下限。預設值：{0}%。</UWU_ComplexityFloorScaleDesc>
  <!-- EN: This setting has no effect while the trait cost multiplier is 0%. -->
  <UWU_CostSettingNoEffect>特質成本倍率為0%時，此設定不會有任何作用。</UWU_CostSettingNoEffect>

