  <!-- EN: The colonist ordered to customize the weapon must have the skill themselves. -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckSubjectPawnDesc>被指派自訂武器的殖民者本身必須具備該技能。</UWU_SkillCheckSubjectPawnDesc>
  <!-- EN: The most skilled colonist on the map -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckSubjectMap>地圖上技能最高的殖民者</UWU_SkillCheckSubjectMap>
  <!-- EN: At least one colonist on the weapon's map must have the skill. The colonist doing the work does not need it. -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckSubjectMapDesc>武器所在地圖上至少要有一名殖民者具備該技能。實際執行工作的殖民者不需要具備。</UWU_SkillCheckSubjectMapDesc>
  <!-- EN: The most skilled colonist anywhere -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckSubjectWorld>任何地方技能最高的殖民者</UWU_SkillCheckSubjectWorld>
