  <UWU_SkillCheckFlatSliderSelects>調整此項會選擇「最低手工技能」。</UWU_SkillCheckFlatSliderSelects>
  <!-- EN: Weaponsmithing expertise (Vanilla Skills Expanded) -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckKindWeaponsmith>武器鍛造專長(Vanilla Skills Expanded)</UWU_SkillCheckKindWeaponsmith>
  <!-- EN: Require the weaponsmithing expertise from Vanilla Skills Expanded. -->
  <UWU_SkillCheckKindWeaponsmithDesc>要求具備 Vanilla Skills Expanded 的武器鍛造專長。</UWU_SkillCheckKindWeaponsmithDesc>

  <!-- Settings: Miscellaneous -->
  <!-- EN: Allow making weapons unique -->
  <UWU_AllowDefConversion>允許將武器轉為獨特武器</UWU_AllowDefConversion>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, adding a trait to a weapon that is not unique will turn it into its unique version, and removing every trait will turn it back. When disabled, only weapons that are already unique can be customized, and one with no traits left will stay unique. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_AllowDefConversionDesc>啟用時，為非獨特武器加入特質會使它變成獨特版本，移除所有特質後則會變回原本的武器。停用時，只有已經是獨特的武器才能自訂，而且特質被全部移除的武器仍會維持獨特。預設值：{0}。</UWU_AllowDefConversionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enable Ideology color options -->
  <UWU_EnableIdeoColors>啟用理念顏色選項</UWU_EnableIdeoColors>
  <!-- EN: Show Ideology and miscellaneous color palettes in the weapon customization color picker. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_EnableIdeoColorsDesc>在武器自訂的顏色選擇器中顯示理念與其他調色盤。預設值：{0}。</UWU_EnableIdeoColorsDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enable structure color options -->
  <UWU_EnableStructureColors>啟用建築顏色選項</UWU_EnableStructureColors>
  <!-- EN: Show the structure color palette in the weapon customization color picker. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_EnableStructureColorsDesc>在武器自訂的顏色選擇器中顯示建築調色盤。預設值：{0}。</UWU_EnableStructureColorsDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enforce trait colors -->
  <UWU_EnforceTraitColors>強制特質顏色</UWU_EnforceTraitColors>
  <!-- EN: Some traits, such as gold inlay and tox rounds, set the color of the weapon. When enabled, a weapon with one of these traits will always use that color. When disabled, adding the trait will select its color, but any other color can be picked instead. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_EnforceTraitColorsDesc>有些特質會決定武器的顏色，例如鑲金與毒性彈藥。啟用時，帶有這類特質的武器一律使用該顏色。停用時，加入特質會選取其顏色，但仍可改選任何其他顏色。預設值：{0}。</UWU_EnforceTraitColorsDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enforce trait count limit -->
  <UWU_EnforceMaxTraitLimit>強制特質數量上限</UWU_EnforceMaxTraitLimit>
  <!-- EN: Unique weapons found in the world never have more than three traits. When enabled, the same limit will apply to customization. When disabled, a weapon can have any number of traits that do not conflict. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_EnforceMaxTraitLimitDesc>在世界上找到的獨特武器最多只有三項特質。啟用時，自訂也適用相同的上限。停用時，武器可以有任意數量互不衝突的特質。預設值：{0}。</UWU_EnforceMaxTraitLimitDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enforce lone trait restrictions -->
  <UWU_EnforceSoleTrait>強制唯一特質限制</UWU_EnforceSoleTrait>
  <!-- EN: Some traits never appear as the only trait on a unique weapon found in the world. When enabled, the same restriction will apply to customization. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_EnforceSoleTraitDesc>有些特質絕不會單獨出現在世界上找到的獨特武器上。啟用時，自訂也適用相同的限制。預設值：{0}。</UWU_EnforceSoleTraitDesc>
  <!-- EN: Restrict available traits to discovered weapons -->
  <UWU_RestrictTraitsToDiscovered>將可用特質限制為已發現的武器</UWU_RestrictTraitsToDiscovered>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, only traits found on unique weapons on your maps or in your caravans can be added. Weapons hidden by fog, sealed away or carried by hostiles do not count. When disabled, every trait can be added. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_RestrictTraitsToDiscoveredDesc>啟用時，只能加入你地圖上或旅隊中的獨特武器所具有的特質。被迷霧遮蔽、已封閉或被敵人持有的武器不算。停用時，所有特質都能加入。預設值：{0}。</UWU_RestrictTraitsToDiscoveredDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enable ground weapon right-click menu -->
  <UWU_EnableGroundCustomization>啟用地面武器的右鍵選單</UWU_EnableGroundCustomization>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, right-clicking a weapon on the ground will offer to customize it. When disabled, the right-click menu stays shorter, and weapons can still be customized by selecting them and pressing the Customize button. Default: {0}. -->
  <UWU_EnableGroundCustomizationDesc>啟用時，在地面的武器上按右鍵會出現自訂選項。停用時，右鍵選單會較短，仍可選取武器後按下「自訂」按鈕來自訂。預設值：{0}。</UWU_EnableGroundCustomizationDesc>

  <!-- Settings: Haul planner -->
  <!-- EN: Sequential -->
  <UWU_HaulPlannerSequential>循序</UWU_HaulPlannerSequential>
  <!-- EN: Colonists will carry one stack of ingredients at a time, taking the nearest first, the same way they do for bills. This is simple and predictable, but expensive customizations will take many short trips. -->
  <UWU_HaulPlannerSequentialDesc>殖民者一次搬運一疊材料，先取最近的，做法與執行工作台上的工作時相同。簡單且可預測，但在成本高的自訂中會來回跑許多趟。</UWU_HaulPlannerSequentialDesc>
  <!-- EN: Sweep -->
  <UWU_HaulPlannerSweep>集中</UWU_HaulPlannerSweep>
  <!-- EN: Colonists will plan ahead, using spare inventory space to carry more at once and taking a shorter route between pickups. This takes far fewer trips than Sequential and has almost no effect on performance. -->
  <UWU_HaulPlannerSweepDesc>殖民者會預先規劃，利用剩餘的攜帶空間一次搬運更多，並在各個取件點之間走較短的路線。往返次數遠少於循序，對效能幾乎沒有影響。</UWU_HaulPlannerSweepDesc>
  <!-- EN: Thorough -->
  <UWU_HaulPlannerThorough>徹底</UWU_HaulPlannerThorough>
  <!-- EN: Like Sweep, but colonists will also weigh which stacks to take from when there are several to choose from, instead of always taking the closest. This is slower to plan, but will usually find the shortest trips when ingredients are scattered or carrying capacity is tight. It will fall back to Sweep for hauls too complex to analyze fully. -->
  <UWU_HaulPlannerThoroughDesc>與集中相似，但有多堆材料可選時，殖民者還會權衡該從哪幾堆取用，而不是一律取最近的。規劃較慢，但在材料分散或負重吃緊時，通常能找出最短的路線。搬運過於複雜而無法完整分析時，會退回使用集中。</UWU_HaulPlannerThoroughDesc>

</LanguageData>
